+Only source artifacts were copied to `/tmp/audit-work/129-minPath`. Candidate-built definitions, caches, and `__pycache__` were not copied or reused. The trusted supplied-semantics tree was used for both fresh definitions. The installed tools independently reported K version `v7.1.293`.
